'start menu' is for the start menu/main menu, it loops

'pause' is played in pause menu, it loops

'puzzles' is the theme for all puzzles room, it loops

'gift' plays when you pick up upgrades, doesnt loop

'the legendary reward' plays for the final puzzzle, loops

'a reward' plays for end of the game, doesnt loop


box sfx plays for boxes moving
footsteps sfx plays for arsonist moving
key sfx plays for using key
lighter sfx plays for lighter being used
skateboard sfx plays for skateboard being used
door sfx plays for door opening
fan sfx plays for fan being used
stapler sfx plays for stapler being used
stapler wall sfx plays for stapler hitting a wall
present sfx plays for gift box opening
falling sfx plays for falling into pit
